# OMNIA bridge — received bundles are not tracked.
# The full OMNIA archive is the evidence vault and lives outside this
# repository. ConsMAP tracks the generated public atlas and the import
# manifest, never the raw bundle, its PDFs, or anything in quarantine.
# See docs/06_omnia/OMNIA_MANUSCRIPT_MAP.md
data/omnia/releases/*
!data/omnia/releases/README.md
